{"id":"n17301-2-20","stage":0,"title":"전 · 前","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n17301-2-20-1","ko":"미안해. 좀 늦었네.","zh":"对不起，我来晚啦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"미안해.","meaning":"抱歉，对不起，不好意思","explanation":"미안하다：抱歉，对不起，不好意思；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"미안하다","audio":"/audio/a3bb8e6d52d6985107bb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67883","senseId":"2","lemma":"미안하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"미안해","audio":"/audio/aacbb9c76d03aaf6939d.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"有点","explanation":"좀：稍微、有点；修饰 늦었네，表示晚了一点。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"늦었네.","meaning":"晚，迟到","explanation":"늦다：晚，迟到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"늦다","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61181","senseId":"1","lemma":"늦다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"늦었네","audio":"/audio/12bfdc71a27d7549aefc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a3bb8e6d52d69851","term":"미안하다","zh":"抱歉，对不起，不好意思","audio":"/audio/a3bb8e6d52d6985107bb.mp3","entryId":"67883","definition":"谦虚地向对方请求谅解。","pronunciation":["미안하다"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一点点，有一点","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"程度稍微；这里表示迟到了一点。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"8678e3dcf30b4fad","term":"늦다","zh":"晚，迟到","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3","entryId":"61181","definition":"过了已定的时间。","pronunciation":["늗따"]}],"audio":"/audio/644521c0f1710b8b948a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n17301-2-20-2","ko":"아니. 나도 조금 전에 왔어.","zh":"没事，我也是刚到不久。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니.","meaning":"没关系","explanation":"아니：否定或安慰的回应；这里对迟到道歉表示“没关系”。","readings":[{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65982","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}},{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나도","audio":"/audio/9630a018a2b2bf43a396.mp3"}},{"text":"조금","meaning":"一会儿","explanation":"조금：短暂时间；与 전에 合用表示“不久前、刚才”。","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"2","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}},{"text":"전에","meaning":"之前","explanation":"전：前；-에 标记时间，조금 전에 表示“刚才不久”。","readings":[{"term":"전","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17301","senseId":"2","lemma":"전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전에","audio":"/audio/2d406c50ea3b8c668815.mp3"}},{"text":"왔어.","meaning":"到，来到","explanation":"오다：到，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"10","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔어","audio":"/audio/1c7a0c0d37b0eadd46f3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"bcf26f704fdac00f","term":"아니","zh":"不、没关系（否定回应）","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3","entryId":"65982","definition":"口语中作否定或安慰回应；这里表示“没关系”。","pronunciation":["아니"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"b4049b7414b62d9b","term":"조금","zh":"片刻，一会儿","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3","entryId":"61176","definition":"短暂时间。","pronunciation":["조금"]},{"id":"d9f427c3257e81e0","term":"전","zh":"前","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3","entryId":"17301","definition":"比一定时期早。","pronunciation":["전"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"到，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"到达想去的地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/826068822763ac1bd8c4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.058,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=17301","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":24,"sequenceScore":1.0344,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["没事，我也是刚到不久。","对不起，我来晚啦。","这是我家那小子。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["对不起，我来晚啦。","这是我家那小子。","没事，我也是刚到不久。"],"answer":2}]}
